<ServiceLayout title="Back Pain" description="Chiropractic treatment for back pain at Frey Clinic of Chiropractic in Napoleon, OH. Find relief without drugs or surgery." schemaType="MedicalCondition">
<p>Back pain is one of the most common reasons people seek chiropractic care — and one of the conditions we treat most effectively. Whether your pain is acute or chronic, our chiropractors in Napoleon, OH can help identify the underlying cause and develop a treatment plan to address it.</p>
<hr class="rule rule--accent" style="margin-block:var(--sp-6);" />
<h2>Common causes of back pain</h2>
<p>Back pain can stem from many sources: poor posture, muscle strain, herniated discs, spinal misalignment, arthritis, or injury. Often, back pain that seems to appear suddenly is actually the result of accumulated stress on the spine over time.</p>
<h2>How chiropractic helps</h2>
<p>Chiropractic adjustments address back pain at its source by restoring proper alignment to the spine. When vertebrae are in their correct position, pressure is relieved from nerves, muscles can relax, and the body can begin to heal. Many patients experience significant improvement within the first few visits.</p>
<p>We also work with you on posture, ergonomics, and exercises to help prevent recurrence. Our goal is not just to relieve your pain, but to help you understand and maintain your spinal health.</p>
